        "filing_date": "2025-09-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to invest in research and development and acquire new technologies and products to add new and differentiated solutions to our existing product portfolio and to improve the overall functionality, reliability, availability and scalability of our cloud security platform.",
